N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET=

# ============================================
# IMPORTANT NOTES:
# ============================================
# 1. FLASK_USE_RELOADER must be false - prevents 2-5s startup delays
# 2. DB_POOL_SIZE controls connection pooling performance
# 3. Change JWT_SECRET in production
# 4. For Gmail: Use App Password, not regular password
#    Get it from: Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords
# 5. Set N8N_WEBHOOK_URL to your actual n8n webhook endpoint for ATS workflow
